    Constructing JAX arrays from Python scalars:

    >>> jnp.array(True)
    Array(True, dtype=bool)
    >>> jnp.array(42)
    Array(42, dtype=int32, weak_type=True)
    >>> jnp.array(3.5)
    Array(3.5, dtype=float32, weak_type=True)
    >>> jnp.array(1 + 1j)
    Array(1.+1.j, dtype=complex64, weak_type=True)

